Let $r$ be the radius of the sphere.  Since the sphere is tangent to all three planes, its center is at $(r,r,r).$  Hence,
\[(r - 41)^2 + (r - 29)^2 + (r - 50)^2 = r^2.\]This simplifies to $r^2 - 120r + 2511 = 0,$ which factors as $(r - 27)(r - 93) = 0.$  Hence, the possible values of $r$ are $\boxed{27,93}.$ </think>
